### User Login API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### 1. User Login - Valid Credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-terminal-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

### 2. User Login - Invalid Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 3. User Login - Invalid Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### 4. User Login - Missing Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 5. User Login - Missing Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 6. User Login - Empty Request Body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{}

### 7. Get Current User Profile (Requires Authentication)
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### Extract token from login response
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.data.token}}

### 8. Get User Profile with Valid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Get User Profile with Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### 10. Logout User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}